{"id":"2fa80316020e129d","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-hashimoto.md","title":"Riemann Xi Function (Legacy Label)","display":"df-hashimoto — Riemann Xi Function (Legacy Label)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hashimoto","aliases":["58-df-hashimoto","Hashimoto Variable"],"display":"df-hashimoto — Riemann Xi Function (Legacy Label)","depends_on":["[[58-df-zeta-function]]","[[58-df-holomorphic-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hashimoto"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hashimoto</span><span>Hashimoto Variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hashimoto — Riemann Xi Function (Legacy Label)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd554d3da5a43116\" href=\"?note=bd554d3da5a43116\" title=\"58-df-zeta-function\">58-df-zeta-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d85f24c98c7d4149\" href=\"?note=d85f24c98c7d4149\" title=\"58-df-holomorphic-function\">58-df-holomorphic-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-hashimoto-—-Hashimoto-Variable\">df-hashimoto — Hashimoto Variable</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta:\\mathbb C\\to\\mathbb C\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(\\zeta:\\mathbb C\\to\\mathbb C\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb C}\">\\(\\xi\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb C}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (Riemann zeta 谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bd554d3da5a43116\" href=\"?note=bd554d3da5a43116\" title=\"58-df-zeta-function\">58-df-zeta-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (全纯函数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d85f24c98c7d4149\" href=\"?note=d85f24c98c7d4149\" title=\"58-df-holomorphic-function\">58-df-holomorphic-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> (标准 Euler gamma 函数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RiemannXi}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{RiemannXi}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (本文件定义的完成 zeta 函数关系)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hashimoto} \\vdash \\mathrm{RiemannXi}_S(\\xi,\\zeta)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S(\\zeta)\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S(\\xi,\\mathbb C)\\land\\xi(0)=\\xi(1)=\\tfrac12\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\\to\\xi(s)=\\tfrac12s(s-1)\\pi^{-s/2}\\Gamma(s/2)\\zeta(s)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hashimoto} \\vdash \\mathrm{RiemannXi}_S(\\xi,\\zeta)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S(\\zeta)\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S(\\xi,\\mathbb C)\\land\\xi(0)=\\xi(1)=\\tfrac12\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\\to\\xi(s)=\\tfrac12s(s-1)\\pi^{-s/2}\\Gamma(s/2)\\zeta(s)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原文件所谓 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi(t)=\\xi(s+it)\">\\(\\chi(t)=\\xi(s+it)\\)</span> 并不是一个标准的 “Hashimoto variable”，且把自由参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 隐藏进单变量函数；现改为实际可定义的 Riemann <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\">\\(\\xi\\)</span> 函数。</li>\n<li>乘积公式只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\">\\(\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\\)</span> 的无极点区域直接使用，并以全纯延拓刻画整函数；这避免在 gamma 极点与 zeta 平凡零点处写未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\cdot\\infty\">\\(0\\cdot\\infty\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>函数方程 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi(s)=\\xi(1-s)\">\\(\\xi(s)=\\xi(1-s)\\)</span> 是该完成函数的定理性性质，不作为定义中的额外未知量。</li>\n<li>Riemann-Siegel: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z(t) = e^{i\\theta(t)}\\zeta(1/2+it)\">\\(Z(t) = e^{i\\theta(t)}\\zeta(1/2+it)\\)</span> is real-valued</li>\n<li>Riemann-Siegel formula: numerically compute large values</li>\n<li>Gram points: where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z(g_n) = 0\">\\(Z(g_n) = 0\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Titchmarsh, The Theory of the Riemann Zeta-Function</li>\n<li>Iwaniec, Quantum Modular Forms</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-hashimoto-—-Hashimoto-Variable","text":"df-hashimoto — Hashimoto Variable","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zeta-function","status":"resolved","id":"bd554d3da5a43116","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zeta-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-holomorphic-function","status":"resolved","id":"d85f24c98c7d4149","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-holomorphic-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zeta-function","status":"resolved","id":"bd554d3da5a43116","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S\\subseteq V$ (Riemann zeta 谓词, see [[58-df-zeta-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-holomorphic-function","status":"resolved","id":"d85f24c98c7d4149","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (全纯函数谓词, see [[58-df-holomorphic-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\zeta:\\mathbb C\\to\\mathbb C\\cup\\{\\infty\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RiemannXi}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hashimoto} \\vdash \\mathrm{RiemannXi}_S(\\xi,\\zeta)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S(\\zeta)\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S(\\xi,\\mathbb C)\\land\\xi(0)=\\xi(1)=\\tfrac12\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Re}(s)>1\\to\\xi(s)=\\tfrac12s(s-1)\\pi^{-s/2}\\Gamma(s/2)\\zeta(s)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi(t)=\\xi(s+it)","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Re}(s)>1","display":false},{"tex":"0\\cdot\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi(s)=\\xi(1-s)","display":false},{"tex":"Z(t) = e^{i\\theta(t)}\\zeta(1/2+it)","display":false},{"tex":"Z(g_n) = 0","display":false}],"bytes":1840,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-608","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-hashimoto.md|58-df-hashimoto]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["bd554d3da5a43116","d85f24c98c7d4149"]}